76847>>>    Object oOKButton is a Button
76849>>>        Set Label to C_$OK
76850>>>        Set Location to 130 195
76851>>>        Set peAnchors to anBottomRight
76852>>>
76852>>>        Procedure OnClick
76855>>>            Handle hoReport hWnd
76855>>>            Integer iExportToOption iRetval
76855>>>            String sFileName sOperation
76855>>>            Boolean bViewPDF
76855>>>
76855>>>            Get phoReport to hoReport
76856>>>            Get Value of oFileNameForm to sFileName
76857>>>
76857>>>            Get ExportToOption of oExportToComboForm to iExportToOption
76858>>>            Case Begin
76858>>>                Case (iExportToOption = C_DRPDF)
76860>>>                    Get CollectPDFExportOptions of oPDFOptionsGroup hoReport to bViewPDF
76861>>>                    Send ExportReport of hoReport C_DRPDF sFileName
76862>>>                    If (bViewPDF) Begin
76864>>>                        Get Window_Handle to hWnd
76865>>>                        Move "OPEN" to sOperation
76866>>>                        Move (DR_WinAPI_ShellExecute (hWnd, AddressOf (sOperation), AddressOf (sFileName), 0, 0, SW_SHOWDEFAULT)) to iRetval
76867>>>                    End
76867>>>>
76867>>>                    Case Break
76868>>>                Case (iExportToOption = C_DRCSV)
76871>>>                    Send CollectCSVExportOptions of oCSVOptionsGroup hoReport
