76891>>>                    Case Break
76892>>>                Case (iExportToOption = C_DRRTF)
76895>>>                    Send CollectRTFOptions of oRTFOptionsGroup hoReport
76896>>>                    Send ExportReport of hoReport C_DRRTF sFileName
76897>>>                    Case Break
76898>>>            Case End
