76996>>>
76996>>>        Procedure Prompt
76999>>>            Integer iExportToOption iIndex
76999>>>            String sFileName
76999>>>            Boolean bSelected
76999>>>
76999>>>            Get ExportToOption of oExportToComboForm to iExportToOption
77000>>>
77000>>>            Case Begin
77000>>>                Case (iExportToOption = C_DRPDF)
77002>>>                    Set Filter_String of oSaveAsFileDialog to C_$DRPDFFileExtensionsFilter
77003>>>                    Set Filter_Index of oSaveAsFileDialog to 1
77004>>>                    Case Break
77005>>>                Case (iExportToOption = C_DRCSV)
77008>>>                    Set Filter_String of oSaveAsFileDialog to C_$DRCSVFileExtensionsFilter
77009>>>                    Set Filter_Index of oSaveAsFileDialog to 1
77010>>>                    Case Break
77011>>>                Case (iExportToOption = C_DRImage)
77014>>>                    Set Filter_String of oSaveAsFileDialog to C_$DRJPGFileExtensionsFilter
77015>>>                    Get ImageType of oImageTypeComboForm to iIndex
77016>>>                    Set Filter_Index of oSaveAsFileDialog to iIndex
77017>>>                    Case Break
77018>>>                Case (iExportToOption = C_DRHTML)
77021>>>                    Set Filter_String of oSaveAsFileDialog to C_$DRHTMLFileExtensionsFilter
77022>>>                    Set Filter_Index of oSaveAsFileDialog to 1
77023>>>                    Case Break
77024>>>                Case (iExportToOption = C_DRXLS)
77027>>>                    Set Filter_String of oSaveAsFileDialog to C_$DRXLSFileExtensionsFilter
77028>>>                    Get XLSVersion of oXLSVersionComboForm to iIndex
77029>>>                    Set Filter_Index of oSaveAsFileDialog to (iIndex + 1)
77030>>>                    Case Break
77031>>>                Case (iExportToOption = C_DRRTF)
77034>>>                    Set Filter_String of oSaveAsFileDialog to C_$DRRTFFileExtensionsFilter
77035>>>                    Set Filter_Index of oSaveAsFileDialog to 1
77036>>>                    Case Break
77037>>>            Case End
77037>>>
77037>>>            Get Value to sFileName
77038>>>            Set File_Title of oSaveAsFileDialog to sFileName
77039>>>            Get Show_Dialog of oSaveAsFileDialog to bSelected
77040>>>            If (bSelected) Begin
77042>>>                Get File_Name of oSaveAsFileDialog to sFileName
77043>>>                Set Value to sFileName
77044>>>            End
77044>>>>
77044>>>        End_Procedure
77045>>>    End_Object
