78673>>>>>>>        Move (iMaxTextWidth + iLabelWidth) to iMaxTextWidth
78674>>>>>>>        
78674>>>>>>>        Move (GetSystemMetrics (SM_CXVSCROLL)) to iThumbWidth
78675>>>>>>>        Move (iMaxTextWidth + iThumbWidth) to iMaxTextWidth
78676>>>>>>>
