81156>>>    // The AddFilter function expects a string. If you move a DateTime to a string the format
81156>>>    // is incorrect for SQL. With this function we can convert the DateTime to string in the appropriate
81156>>>    // format (this is yyyy-mm-dd hh:mm:ss)). The prefix zeroes are important.
81156>>>    Function DateTimeToString DateTime dtIn Returns String
81158>>>        String sDateTimeResult
81158>>>
81158>>>        Get DateTimeToString of oDRReportHelper dtIn to sDateTimeResult
81159>>>
81159>>>        Function_Return sDateTimeResult
81160>>>    End_Function
81161>>>
81161>>>    // The AddFilter function expects a string. If you move a Date to a string the format
81161>>>    // is incorrect for SQL. With this function we can convert the Date to string first in the appropriate
81161>>>    // format (this is yyyy-mm-dd). The prefix zeroes are important.
81161>>>    Function DateToString Date dIn Returns String
81163>>>        String sDateResult
81163>>>
81163>>>        Get DateToString of oDRReportHelper dIn to sDateResult
81164>>>
