81166>>>    // Returns defaults for exporting to CSV
81166>>>    Function DefaultCSVExportOptions Returns DRCSVExportOptions
81168>>>        DRCSVExportOptions CSVExportOptions
81168>>>        DRCSVExportOptions CSVExportOptions
81168>>>
81168>>>        Move '"' to CSVExportOptions.cFieldSeparator
81169>>>        Move ',' to CSVExportOptions.cFieldDelimiter
81170>>>        Move False to CSVExportOptions.bExportGroupSections
81171>>>        Move False to CSVExportOptions.bExportPageSections
81172>>>        Move False to CSVExportOptions.bExportReportSections
81173>>>        Move True to CSVExportOptions.bAllPages
81174>>>        Move 1 to CSVExportOptions.iPage
81175>>>
81175>>>        Function_Return CSVExportOptions
