81221>>>    Procedure DisplayReport
81223>>>        Boolean bCancel bComObjectCreated bPreviewContainerIsActive
81223>>>        Handle hoPreviewContainer hoClientArea hcPreviewer
81223>>>        Integer ePreviewStyle
81223>>>        String sReportId sPreviewCaptionLabel
81223>>>
81223>>>        Send RedirectErrorsToLocalHandler True
