81378>>>>
81378>>>            End
81378>>>>
81378>>>        End
81378>>>>
81378>>>        Send OnPostExportReport iExportType sFileName
81379>>>        Send CheckFunctionErrorInfo
81380>>>
81380>>>        Send RedirectErrorsToLocalHandler False
