81401>>>    // Functionality is the same as in FilterCount when the report does not contain sub-reports
81401>>>    // If the report contains sub-reports these are consulted to find out if there are filters
81401>>>    // defined there.
81401>>>    Function FiltersDefined String sReportId Returns Boolean
81403>>>        Integer iFilters iSubReports iSubReport
81403>>>        String sSubReportId
81403>>>        Boolean bFiltersDefined
81403>>>
81403>>>        Get FilterCount sReportId to iFilters
81404>>>        If (iFilters > 0) Begin
81406>>>            Move True to bFiltersDefined
81407>>>        End
81407>>>>
81407>>>        Else Begin
81408>>>            Get SubReportCount sReportId to iSubReports
81409>>>            Decrement iSubReports
81410>>>            For iSubReport from 0 to iSubReports
81416>>>>
81416>>>                Get SubReportId sReportId iSubReport to sSubReportId
81417>>>                Get FiltersDefined sSubReportId to bFiltersDefined
81418>>>                If (bFiltersDefined) ;                    Break
81421>>>            Loop
81422>>>>
81422>>>        End
81422>>>>
81422>>>
81422>>>        Function_Return bFiltersDefined
