82894>>>    // Prints the report
82894>>>    // If the hPrinterDlg parameter is passed as zero DataFlex Reports will
82894>>>    // popup a print dialog to choose a printer from. When you do not want a printer dialog
82894>>>    // (for example because the information is stored in a record or file) you need to pass
82894>>>    // the handle to the PRINTDLGEX structure.
82894>>>    Procedure PrintReport Handle hPrinterDlg
