83887>>>        If (XLSExportOptionsData.iXLSVersion < C_DRXLS2003 or XLSExportOptionsData.iXLSVersion > C_DRXLS2007) Begin
83889>>>            Error DFERR_DATAFLEX_REPORTS C_$DRXLSVersionNumberIncorrect
