85164>>>//************************************************************************
85164>>>//
85164>>>// $File name  : StdAbout.pkg
85164>>>// $File title : Standard about object package for VDF
85164>>>// Notice      :
85164>>>// $Author(s)  : John Tuohy
85164>>>//
85164>>>// $Rev History
85164>>>//
85164>>>// JT 06/27/97   File created
85164>>>//************************************************************************
85164>>>
85164>>>// This provides a quick and simple way to create an about package for a program.
85164>>>// You need to create a message inside you client area called Activate_About.
85164>>>// Within this message you should send the message DoAbout passing needed
85164>>>// string information.
85164>>>//
85164>>>//       Procedure Activate_About
85164>>>//           Send DoAbout sTitle sVersion sCopyright sAuthor sBitmap
85164>>>//       End_Procedure
85164>>>//    where: sTitle =     Name of application. If none provided, uses caption
85164>>>//                        bar title
85164>>>//           sVersion   = Version Line. If none provided, will be blank
85164>>>//           sCopyRight = Copyright Line. If none provided, will be blank
85164>>>//           sAuthor    = Author name, blank if none provided
85164>>>//           sBitMap    = Bitmap logo. If none provided, standard VDF bitmap
85164>>>//                        is used.
85164>>>// It is expected that you will place this in your own object package. For
85164>>>// example an order about package may look like this:
85164>>>//
85164>>>//   // OrderAbout.pkg
85164>>>//   Use StdAbout.pkg
85164>>>//   Procedure Activate_About
85164>>>//      String sTitle sCopyright sVersion sAuthor
85164>>>//      Move "My Order Entry System" to sTitle
85164>>>//      Move "Version 2.1" to sVersion
85164>>>//      Move "Copyright 1997, Super Software Inc." to sCopyright
85164>>>//      Move "John Smith"  to sAuthor
85164>>>//      Send DoAbout sTitle sVersion sCopyright sAuthor ""
85164>>>//   end_procedure
85164>>>//   // end of file.
85164>>>
85164>>>Use DfAbout.pkg
Including file: Dfabout.pkg    (C:\Program Files (x86)\DataFlex 18.2\Pkg\Dfabout.pkg)
