85208>>>>>>>    Function CKMajorRevision Returns Integer
85210>>>>>>>        Function_Return (ExtractPartFromRevision (Current_Object, 1, CKRevision(Current_Object)))
85211>>>>>>>    End_Function // CKMajorRevision
