85378>>>>>>>    //***
85378>>>>>>>    //*** Function: LastDriverError
85378>>>>>>>    //*** Purpose : Return the text f the last error geneated by the driver.
85378>>>>>>>    //***
85378>>>>>>>
85378>>>>>>>    Function LastDriverError Returns String
85380>>>>>>>        Local String  sDriverID
85380>>>>>>>        Local String  sLastError
85380>>>>>>>        Local String  sLastErrorLength
85380>>>>>>>        Local Integer iLastErrorLength
85380>>>>>>>        Local Integer iVoid
85380>>>>>>>
85380>>>>>>>        //*** Initialize
85380>>>>>>>        Move "" To sLastError
85381>>>>>>>
85381>>>>>>>        Get psDriverID To sDriverID
85382>>>>>>>        If (sDriverID <> "") Begin
85384>>>>>>>            //*** Get the text of the last error
85384>>>>>>>            Move (Repeat(Character(" "), 14)) To sLastErrorlength
85385>>>>>>>            Call_driver 0 sDriverID Function CLI_GETDRIVERATTRIBUTE Callback 0 Passing sLastErrorLength iVoid DRVR_LASTERRORTEXTLENGTH Result iVoid
85390>>>>>>>            Move (Left(sLastErrorLength, Pos(Character(0), sLastErrorLength) - 1)) To iLastErrorLength
85391>>>>>>>
85391>>>>>>>            If (iLastErrorLength > 0) Begin
85393>>>>>>>                Move (Repeat(Character(" "), iLastErrorLength + 1)) To sLastError
85394>>>>>>>                Call_driver 0 sDriverID Function CLI_GETDRIVERATTRIBUTE Callback 0 Passing sLastError iVoid DRVR_LASTERRORTEXT Result iVoid
85399>>>>>>>                Move (Left(sLastError, Pos(Character(0), sLastError) - 1)) To sLastError
85400>>>>>>>            End
85400>>>>>>>>
85400>>>>>>>        End
85400>>>>>>>>
85400>>>>>>>
85400>>>>>>>        Function_Return sLastError
85401>>>>>>>    End_Function // LastDriverError
