85749>>>>>//****************************************************************************
85749>>>>>// $Module type: FUNCTION
85749>>>>>// $Module name: Network_User_Name
85749>>>>>// $Author     : AK/VOO/KCR
85749>>>>>// Created     : 09-24-96 @ 19:17
85749>>>>>//
85749>>>>>// Description
85749>>>>>//    This function reads the current username Of windows and returns that
85749>>>>>//    name or an text unknown user
85749>>>>>//
85749>>>>>// $Rev History
85749>>>>>//  02/22/2012  Ask Windows how long the size of the name should be
85749>>>>>//  07/25/2003  Replaced obsolete code
85749>>>>>//  09/24/1996  Module header created
85749>>>>>//****************************************************************************
85749>>>>>Function Network_User_Name for cDesktop Returns String
85751>>>>>    String sName
85751>>>>>    Integer iRetval iLength
85751>>>>>
85751>>>>>    Move 0 to iLength
85752>>>>>    Move (WNetGetUser (0, 0, AddressOf (iLength))) to iRetval
85753>>>>>    ZeroString iLength to sName
85754>>>>>    Move (WNetGetUser (0, AddressOf (sName), AddressOf (iLength))) to iRetval
85755>>>>>
85755>>>>>    If (iRetval = NO_ERROR) Begin
85757>>>>>        Function_Return (CString (sName))
85758>>>>>    End
85758>>>>>>
85758>>>>>    
85758>>>>>    Function_Return "User Unknown"
85759>>>>>End_Function
85760>>>>>
85760>>>>>// OBSOLETE STRUCTURE AND WINDOWS API CALL. KEPT FOR BACKWARDS COMPATIBILITY
85760>>>>>Type MEMORYSTATUS
85760>>>>>   Field MEMORYSTATUS.dwLength         as DWord // sizeof(MEMORYSTATUS)
85760>>>>>   Field MEMORYSTATUS.dwMemoryLoad     as DWord // percent Of memory in use
85760>>>>>   Field MEMORYSTATUS.dwTotalPhys      as DWord // bytes Of physical memory
85760>>>>>   Field MEMORYSTATUS.dwAvailPhys      as DWord // free physical memory bytes
85760>>>>>   Field MEMORYSTATUS.dwTotalPageFile  as DWord // bytes Of paging file
85760>>>>>   Field MEMORYSTATUS.dwAvailPageFile  as DWord // free bytes Of paging file
85760>>>>>   Field MEMORYSTATUS.dwTotalVirtual   as DWord // user bytes Of address space
85760>>>>>   Field MEMORYSTATUS.dwAvailVirtual   as DWord // free user bytes
85760>>>>>End_Type // MEMORYSTATUS
85760>>>>>
85760>>>>>External_Function GlobalMemoryStatus "GlobalMemoryStatus" Kernel32.Dll Pointer lpsMemoryStatus Returns Integer
85761>>>>>
85761>>>>>Struct tWinMemoryStatusEx
85761>>>>>    UInteger dwLength                
85761>>>>>    UInteger dwMemoryLoad          
85761>>>>>    UBigInt ullTotalPhys           
85761>>>>>    UBigInt ullAvailPhys           
85761>>>>>    UBigInt ullTotalPageFile       
85761>>>>>    UBigInt ullAvailPageFile       
85761>>>>>    UBigInt ullTotalVirtual        
85761>>>>>    UBigInt ullAvailVirtual        
85761>>>>>    UBigInt ullAvailExtendedVirtual
85761>>>>>End_Struct
