85836>>>>>    Procedure Show_Date_Format
85838>>>>>        Integer iDateFormat
85838>>>>>        String sDateFormat
85838>>>>>
85838>>>>>        Get_Attribute DF_DATE_FORMAT to iDateFormat
85841>>>>>        Case Begin
85841>>>>>            Case (iDateFormat = DF_DATE_USA)
85843>>>>>                Move C_$USA To sDateFormat
85844>>>>>                Case Break
85845>>>>>            Case (iDateFormat = DF_DATE_EUROPEAN)
85848>>>>>                Move C_$European To sDateFormat
85849>>>>>                Case Break
85850>>>>>            Case (iDateFormat = DF_DATE_MILITARY)
85853>>>>>                Move C_$Military To sDateFormat
85854>>>>>                Case Break
85855>>>>>            Case Else
85855>>>>>                Move C_$UnknownDateType To sDateFormat
85856>>>>>                Case Break
85857>>>>>        Case End
85857>>>>>
85857>>>>>        Send AppendTextLn (SFormat (C_$DateFormat, sDateformat))
