86692>>>>>
86692>>>>>            //*** Pass the argument
86692>>>>>            Call_driver 0 sDrvrId Function FUNC_SQLSETPROCARG ;                        Callback Current_Object ;                        Passing sArgument sEmpty 0 ;                        Result iVoid
86697>>>>>        End
