86762>>>>>        Get phStmtConnection  To ihdbc
86763>>>>>
86763>>>>>        //*** Call the procedure
86763>>>>>        If (ihstmt <> 0 And ihdbc <> 0 And sDrvrId <> "") Begin
86765>>>>>            //*** Get the length
