87788>>>        Set Value of oTOTAL_INGRESOS    to nTOTAL_INGRESOS
87789>>>        Set Value of oDIFERENCIA2       to nDIFERENCIA
87790>>>        Set Value of oPENDIENTE         to nPENDIENTE_PAGO
87791>>>        Set Value of oTOTAL_PGDO        to nTOTAL_PGO
87792>>>        Set Value of oDISPONIBLE        to nDISPONIBLE
87793>>>        
