89000>>>        SQLClose hstmt69
89003>>>        SQLDisconnect hdbc69
89006>>>        
89006>>>        Set Value of oTOTAL         to nMonto
89007>>>        Set Value of oTOTAL_PROYECT to nMontoEsp
